            <div xml:id="m-921b35e6-7f24-4699-af8b-a1e3f31c43d3">
              <lg xml:id="m-03f3ae64-d159-4005-95c1-a044fef9e415">
                <l xml:id="m-38f77fcd-621c-4cfe-815a-a0385bc7e068" facs="#m-4e453bc4-5ee6-4046-9095-381c3f704f11" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-86bdee84-73c8-49a7-a5b0-286d81d58da8" facs="#m-8ecd5423-1392-4073-bea7-a7ea55165cce" label="ambiguous">930</l><l xml:id="m-9b33b2ff-8373-4a1e-9a79-c200711791e2" facs="#m-33182ecf-19e7-4387-93d2-3d9c6ca01b16" label="lyrics-like">propter me. V. Cibá-vit fl-lum</l><l xml:id="m-6aee126f-f32e-4976-97ab-2caaa1523e9a" facs="#m-a3e75a62-479f-4d43-b5b0-f27fb083a5cf" label="ambiguous">me,</l><l xml:id="m-16698d08-bfca-4ef3-8a5d-a73223aeb8f3" facs="#m-b2d01795-9c58-4df0-bf16-32d94943cbcc" label="lyrics-like">ví- vet</l><l xml:id="m-aec4cfd9-f64e-4581-922b-899d4b8c90bd" facs="#m-0d61faa8-40ee-4b5a-a4eb-638929881ff8" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus pâ-ne ví-tae</l><l xml:id="m-794eed17-4544-43e5-bb1f-9fffb0858621" facs="#m-d5608723-8829-4c16-a881-87c0b9da9518" label="lyrics-like">et in-tel-léctus."Et qui. Gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-229128ec-d344-45ee-9d91-199ce43ac2a8" facs="#m-c58f0a88-7d33-4786-9456-1bdd7615f34e" label="lyrics-like">ri- a Pátri,</l><l xml:id="m-d1e9b13a-465f-4e8d-88c7-f576eb7516b8" facs="#m-55e8ef86-998b-4f9f-86f6-4da560edf4f0" label="lyrics-like">et Fí-li-o et Spi-rí-tu-i Sán- cto.</l><l xml:id="m-076abade-9b50-40b9-8f2b-015a58042995" facs="#m-17e3126a-4161-4bfb-8311-702485e73a35" label="ambiguous">Et qui.</l><l xml:id="m-0dd32dd7-2116-4185-9f1c-7d37f0c69ae8" facs="#m-65dd690a-430d-454b-a404-8752b7403ef0" label="lyrics-like">The Lector: Jube, domne, benedícere.</l><l xml:id="m-7d5f3e82-ea74-475c-8a19-9a1134e0714d" facs="#m-366d0c5b-5c34-4697-8267-a81f0ed34e1a" label="lyrics-like">Blessing: Ad societátem cívium supernórum * perdúcat nos Rex</l><l xml:id="m-8dcffb28-f8ec-4b40-903e-1c40b40b834f" facs="#m-356ecfcb-8f37-4802-bf14-85fd1f535458" label="lyrics-like">Angelórum. E. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-c45ae633-8db7-4547-a0cb-fa182f522711" facs="#m-2850ace4-57af-4989-a1a2-45c6bb857514" label="ambiguous">Lesson IX.</l><l xml:id="m-df337b8f-2655-466b-bace-a2a21706a6e4" facs="#m-48437966-dfb4-4e33-9949-f845d23d8993" label="lyrics-like">NIcut, inquit, misit me vivens! propter Patrem, ille eréctus vivit</l><l xml:id="m-83efd2f3-8a41-48a2-a007-7cf1708a5068" facs="#m-97cb2376-270a-42d7-8f24-a68ee52208eb" label="ambiguous">O Pater, et ego vivo propter Pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-5423ac78-3b22-4393-9f1b-937ffdc51625" facs="#m-42d9477b-eea7-418d-8438-30a4b2ab23ff" label="ambiguous">propter me. Si autem ita dictum</l><l xml:id="m-0c12660d-ac92-4f57-ae65-76f18989e58f" facs="#m-eab9c770-d6fc-4eac-92a6-7f4948813109" label="ambiguous">est, Vivo propter Patrem, quia ipse</l><l xml:id="m-0c624dc8-7f09-4b63-8842-fe365ac7a76d" facs="#m-22d40278-e169-42d4-a4e9-c7e1946722e4" label="lyrics-like">trem: et qui mandúcat me, et ipse</l><l xml:id="m-9b8a6d79-f99b-43a4-ae5e-26cea74c6686" facs="#m-8ad80648-9328-4c0f-a590-20fafa583710" label="lyrics-like">vivet propter me. Ac si díceret:</l><l xml:id="m-60214410-55c1-4a6f-ad76-1bc69cc30ad7" facs="#m-281d4a48-00e4-415b-83a4-4a3ef2d72fe3" label="ambiguous">de illo, non ille de ipso est: sine</l><l xml:id="m-6bf31ae4-5971-4217-b9c4-72499f63d075" facs="#m-676a2e04-695e-4199-9795-2e7fee97974a" label="lyrics-like">detriménto aequalitátis dictum est.</l><l xml:id="m-0336db56-4fad-4354-8e29-80f9c6ca391a" facs="#m-f52aa466-e38a-44cd-9e3a-63e2b0b5eac4" label="ambiguous">Ut ego vivam propter Patrem, id</l><l xml:id="m-bba78ab7-17fd-42d5-bdb8-5fbd2709952b" facs="#m-c4469bd6-19af-479d-b96d-226f0031a6bd" label="lyrics-like">Nec tamen dicéndo, Et qui mandú¬</l><l xml:id="m-adc6de3e-51bb-4104-90e9-56f31b935174" facs="#m-aa40e80c-9f14-4872-ac61-4f6be8fe37db" label="lyrics-like">est, ad illum tanquam ad majórem</l><l xml:id="m-e405ae6b-a8af-427e-9bb2-6eeebbc32ed6" facs="#m-64732ebc-bd15-46fd-a4b9-ca60ef42ee89" label="ambiguous">cat me, et ipse vivet propter me</l><l xml:id="m-85a255b6-c3f3-4564-adfb-116f48954478" facs="#m-65dd80a7-5499-45db-a2d4-c203d9016f6c" label="lyrics-like">réferam vitam meam, exinanítio</l><l xml:id="m-1b577a47-ec13-4567-ac40-594f6cc503bc" facs="#m-fc900204-00af-4a22-a7b0-68a7a57a8de4" label="ambiguous">mea fecit, in qua me misit. Ut</l><l xml:id="m-649e04c8-493d-457a-adef-4cb6c5cffcb6" facs="#m-8c7e6bf7-99ad-4fee-ab3e-f845e22eb6ef" label="lyrics-like">eámdem suam et nostram aequali¬</l><l xml:id="m-0afd2a58-c920-45c4-b890-f9bc88387763" facs="#m-dd59d205-eb3a-4cee-919d-c1b3db789cb8" label="lyrics-like">tátem significávit, sed grátiam me¬</l><l xml:id="m-67546fc6-9e6c-4c6f-8330-179b860ad854" facs="#m-d099cbf1-2764-465c-85b8-573883671b5f" label="ambiguous">autem quisquam vivat propter me,</l><l xml:id="m-b1324a42-3955-4326-9a5e-a8463608c68b" facs="#m-30b6be22-b11d-4366-a319-a133c23a23c5" label="lyrics-like">participãtio facit, qua mandúcat diatóris osténdit.</l><l xml:id="m-e4267cbf-fc88-43ed-bc36-4e443c219404" facs="#m-e3630587-ce54-409c-bb21-806a0be7d522" label="lyrics-like">Te Deum laudámus. p. 1834.</l><l xml:id="m-a01cf734-9f8c-4bec-8e16-15c28e88ffa9" facs="#m-1328663b-b063-4bcd-a87b-4031c51e733a" label="lyrics-like">me. Ego ítaque humiliátus vivo!</l><l xml:id="m-bfd1ce7c-49ba-409e-a020-eebbdfb3d2f0" facs="#m-69f07ce4-3dc0-42d7-987d-be5ba2880418" label="text-like">AT LAUDS.</l><l xml:id="m-b2f32bfb-c719-4dbc-94db-dbf3a27108f0" facs="#m-43772ba3-a67a-4815-b17d-ae81823d7c4c" label="text-like">Psalms of Feasts, p. 221.</l><l xml:id="m-6bc99a74-a574-4834-a3e1-11467470a7c2" facs="#m-18d4b06b-dcda-430a-9715-7112653557c5" label="ambiguous">1,Ant.H</l><l xml:id="m-92f01732-44ff-49aa-991b-5c1f1ffc0a96" facs="#m-1f5d9ebd-2a4b-417b-8708-80e3181c4921" label="ambiguous">1.a3</l><l xml:id="m-f623284f-f8b5-4b01-9e99-28ca9531744d" facs="#m-ad95de16-a465-415d-a85a-3af338b38939" label="lyrics-like">A-pi-én-ti-a “ ae-di-fi-cávit sí-bi dómum, mí¬</l><l xml:id="m-4c05e3a1-964a-4c74-a89c-3f61c55114b4" facs="#m-d4a03ad5-2999-432d-9e3a-947c7bfe01cd" label="lyrics-like">scu- it ví-num, et pósu-it ménsam, alle-lú¬ ia</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>